Value VLAN (.+)
Value CPU_PACKETS (\d+)
Value PACKETS_LEARN (\d+)
Value IGMP_CONTROL (\d+)
Value IGMP_DATA (\d+)
Value MLD_CONTROL (\d+)
Value MLD_DATA (\d+)

Start
  ^Bridge interface on VLAN ${VLAN}:
  ^Total number of packets to CPU = ${CPU_PACKETS}.
  ^Total number of packets learned = ${PACKETS_LEARN}.
  ^Total number of IGMP control packets snooped = ${IGMP_CONTROL}.
  ^Total number of IGMP data packets switched = ${IGMP_DATA}.
  ^Total number of MLD control packets snooped = ${MLD_CONTROL}.
  ^Total number of MLD data packets switched = ${MLD_DATA}. -> Record